.pnpm-debug.log*

# lighthouse lab artifacts
lh-*.json

# next dev writes AGENTS.md into its project dir (frontend/) whenever it detects
# an AI agent; the canonical copy is the root AGENTS.md (see ADR-007), so never
# commit the generated duplicate.
frontend/AGENTS.md
